' * w' a then k' * w' a - k * w a else k * w a - k' * w' a\n       19→\n       20→/-- Lemma 2: if Σ_a |k'w'(a) − kw(a)| ≤ 1 (so the scaled weights agree on all\n       21→    but at most one node, where they differ by 1), then every weighted majority\n       22→    under `w` meets every weighted majority under `w'`. -/\n       23→theorem majOverlap {A : Type} [DecidableEq A]\n       24→    (nodes : List A) (hnd : nodes.Nodup)\n       25→    (w w' : A → Nat) (k k' : Nat) (hk : 0 < k) (hk' : 0 < k')\n       26→    (hdiff : (nodes.map (wdiff w w' k k')).sum ≤ 1)\n       27→    (q q' : List A) (hq : Maj nodes w q) (hq' : Maj nodes w' q') :\n       28→    ∃ a, a ∈ q ∧ a ∈ q' := by\n       29→  sorry", "numLines": 29, "startLine": 1, "requestedOffset": null, "requestedLimit": 2000, "totalLines": 29, "wasTruncated": false}, "outputText": "", "durationMs": 1.516500000434462, "display": {"success": true, "verb": "Read", "message": "29 lines from Weights.lean", "warnings": [], "suffix": ""}}}
